<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2001073044"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1699491666"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="IVORY TOWER (feat. SennaRin)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="澤野弘之 / SennaRin"/><amll:meta key="album" value="《龙族》动画OST"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:49.980"><div begin="00:08.110" end="02:49.980"><p begin="00:08.110" end="00:11.020" itunes:key="L1">It's not easy lose my grip<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要我失控也非易事 因为梦想召唤着我</span></p><p begin="00:11.020" end="00:12.390" itunes:key="L2">Those dreams are calling me</p><p begin="00:12.390" end="00:13.870" itunes:key="L3">Like a hermit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正如隐士总是寻找着避世逃离的借口</span></p><p begin="00:13.870" end="00:16.260" itunes:key="L4">Used to find a reason not to be</p><p begin="00:16.260" end="00:20.240" itunes:key="L5">You teach me about the history of our fallen heroes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而你跟我讲述那些陨落英雄的光荣事迹</span></p><p begin="00:20.240" end="00:23.710" itunes:key="L6">Realize I have found a solid companion<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">意识到我已寻到一个可靠的伙伴</span></p><p begin="00:23.710" end="00:25.750" itunes:key="L7">'Cause I was afraid<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因</span></p><p begin="00:25.750" end="00:27.500" itunes:key="L8">Was alone in a cave<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我孤身一人</span></p><p begin="00:27.500" end="00:31.580" itunes:key="L9">Like a stone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这暗无天日的洞穴</span></p><p begin="00:31.580" end="00:33.560" itunes:key="L10">This dance is so dangerous<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这</span></p><p begin="00:33.560" end="00:35.590" itunes:key="L11">So cryptic it changes us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却又如此神秘 它改变了你我</span></p><p begin="00:35.590" end="00:37.440" itunes:key="L12">But the secrets that we learn<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们所得知的秘密</span></p><p begin="00:37.440" end="00:39.880" itunes:key="L13">Can give power to all of us?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终会给我们无尽的力量</span></p><p begin="00:39.880" end="00:41.720" itunes:key="L14">Dance shook me dangerous<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不敢轻易迈动舞步</span></p><p begin="00:41.720" end="00:43.650" itunes:key="L15">So glad that you came to us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">很高兴你愿意加入我们</span></p><p begin="00:43.650" end="00:47.560" itunes:key="L16">Can a lesson that we learn transform our view?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们所吸取的教训能让我们转变观念吗？</span></p><p begin="00:47.560" end="00:47.910" itunes:key="L17">Do you hear me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否听到我的呐喊？</span></p><p begin="00:47.910" end="00:49.750" itunes:key="L18">Destination<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后的终点</span></p><p begin="00:49.750" end="00:51.250" itunes:key="L19">I gotta invitation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我势要抵达</span></p><p begin="00:51.250" end="00:53.830" itunes:key="L20">I gonna change all my sense of reality<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要重新领悟</span></p><p begin="00:53.830" end="00:55.380" itunes:key="L21">Gonna change reality<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这现实世界</span></p><p begin="00:55.380" end="00:57.740" itunes:key="L22">Come on, my destination<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 加入吧</span></p><p begin="00:57.740" end="00:59.290" itunes:key="L23">I got my information<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我势要抵达</span></p><p begin="00:59.290" end="01:01.820" itunes:key="L24">I gonna change all my sense of reality<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要重新领悟</span></p><p begin="01:01.820" end="01:04.040" itunes:key="L25">Gonna change reality<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这现实世界</span></p><p begin="01:04.040" end="01:05.780" itunes:key="L26">In too deep<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法自拔</span></p><p begin="01:05.780" end="01:08.150" itunes:key="L27">When did we pass the point of no return<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟要到何时才不必这般不死不休？</span></p><p begin="01:08.150" end="01:10.740" itunes:key="L28">A new way to slay the beast<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寻到斩杀野兽的新办法</span></p><p begin="01:10.740" end="01:12.130" itunes:key="L29">We're gonna beat the burn<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们终会浴火重生 战胜一切</span></p><p begin="01:12.130" end="01:13.380" itunes:key="L30">Don't think twice<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别再犹豫 摧毁桎梏的高墙</span></p><p begin="01:13.380" end="01:16.050" itunes:key="L31">Keep on pounding on the wall till it shatters</p><p begin="01:16.050" end="01:17.250" itunes:key="L32">Turn the tide<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">力挽狂澜</span></p><p begin="01:17.250" end="01:19.770" itunes:key="L33">Gotta climb the ladder that matters<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">登攀梦想的阶梯</span></p><p begin="01:19.770" end="01:21.620" itunes:key="L34">'Cause I was afraid<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为</span></p><p begin="01:21.620" end="01:23.610" itunes:key="L35">Was alone in a cave<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我孤身一人</span></p><p begin="01:23.610" end="01:27.710" itunes:key="L36">Like a stone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这暗无天日的洞穴</span></p><p begin="01:27.710" end="01:29.640" itunes:key="L37">This dance is so dangerous<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这</span></p><p begin="01:29.640" end="01:31.560" itunes:key="L38">So cryptic it changes us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却又如此神秘 它改变了你我</span></p><p begin="01:31.560" end="01:33.220" itunes:key="L39">But the secrets that we learn<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们所得知的秘密</span></p><p begin="01:33.220" end="01:35.720" itunes:key="L40">Can give power to all of us?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终会给我们无尽的力量</span></p><p begin="01:35.720" end="01:37.730" itunes:key="L41">Dance shook me dangerous<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不敢轻易迈动舞步</span></p><p begin="01:37.730" end="01:39.610" itunes:key="L42">So glad that you came to us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">很高兴你愿意加入我们</span></p><p begin="01:39.610" end="01:43.470" itunes:key="L43">Can a lesson that we learn transform our view?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们所吸取的教训能让我们转变观念吗</span></p><p begin="01:43.470" end="01:43.820" itunes:key="L44">Do you hear me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否听到我的呐喊？</span></p><p begin="01:43.820" end="01:45.530" itunes:key="L45">Destination<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后的终点</span></p><p begin="01:45.530" end="01:47.030" itunes:key="L46">I gotta invitation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我势要抵达</span></p><p begin="01:47.030" end="01:49.680" itunes:key="L47">I gonna change all my sense of reality<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要重新领悟</span></p><p begin="01:49.680" end="01:51.350" itunes:key="L48">Gonna change reality<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这现实世界</span></p><p begin="01:51.350" end="01:53.490" itunes:key="L49">Come on, my destination<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 加入吧</span></p><p begin="01:53.490" end="01:55.040" itunes:key="L50">I got my information<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我势要抵达</span></p><p begin="01:55.040" end="01:57.590" itunes:key="L51">I gonna change all my sense of reality<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要重新领悟</span></p><p begin="01:57.590" end="02:03.070" itunes:key="L52">Gonna change reality<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这现实世界</span></p><p begin="02:03.070" end="02:05.080" itunes:key="L53">Can hear me calling?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能否听到他们的召唤？</span></p><p begin="02:05.080" end="02:11.280" itunes:key="L54">Can hear me calling?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能否听到他们的召唤？</span></p><p begin="02:11.280" end="02:13.100" itunes:key="L55">Can hear me calling?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能否听到他们的召唤？</span></p><p begin="02:13.100" end="02:17.130" itunes:key="L56">Can hear me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能否听到他们的召唤？</span></p><p begin="02:17.130" end="02:18.970" itunes:key="L57">Fight for us!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就奋战到底吧</span></p><p begin="02:18.970" end="02:22.460" itunes:key="L58">Can hear them calling from towers that we trust?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能否听到他们置身信任高塔的声声呼唤？</span></p><p begin="02:22.460" end="02:24.860" itunes:key="L59">Can feel the legacy grow?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能感觉到遗留的问题愈来愈多吗</span></p><p begin="02:24.860" end="02:26.010" itunes:key="L60">And so we must stand<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我们必须</span></p><p begin="02:26.010" end="02:27.840" itunes:key="L61">Together be tight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">必须齐心协力</span></p><p begin="02:27.840" end="02:30.020" itunes:key="L62">Making everything right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">团结一心</span></p><p begin="02:30.020" end="02:33.180" itunes:key="L63">Empowers you to be strong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而你拥有更强大的力量</span></p><p begin="02:33.180" end="02:33.810" itunes:key="L64">Do you hear me?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否听到我的呐喊？</span></p><p begin="02:33.810" end="02:35.550" itunes:key="L65">Destination<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后的终点</span></p><p begin="02:35.550" end="02:36.890" itunes:key="L66">I gotta invitation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我势要抵达</span></p><p begin="02:36.890" end="02:39.330" itunes:key="L67">I gonna change all my sense of reality<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要重新领悟</span></p><p begin="02:39.330" end="02:41.390" itunes:key="L68">Gonna change reality<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这现实世界</span></p><p begin="02:41.390" end="02:43.250" itunes:key="L69">Come on, my destination<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 加入吧</span></p><p begin="02:43.250" end="02:44.960" itunes:key="L70">I got my information<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后的终点</span></p><p begin="02:44.960" end="02:47.410" itunes:key="L71">I gonna change all my sense of reality<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我势要抵达</span></p><p begin="02:47.410" end="02:49.980" itunes:key="L72">Gonna change reality<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这现实世界</span></p></div></body></tt>